            },
            "description": "Allowed values: ACTIVE, INACTIVE, SUSPENDED, LOCKED, PENDING_VERIFICATION, DELETED. Every non-ACTIVE status blocks the account's API access — the next request reactivates it so later folders can keep using member_access_token."
